# - T_l^{sν}(Q) is the rotation coefficient for rotating from frame with r_0 direction back to original frame
# - T_n^{νm}(Q^(-1)) is the rotation coefficient for rotating from original frame to r_0 direction frame
# - (R|R)_{ln}^ν(r_0) is the translation coefficient along z-direction by |r_0|
